#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:3
#: a7c0406766c541dfbb24183ad317d664
msgid "随机空位（Random Vacancy）"
msgstr "Random Vacancy"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:5
#: 16334f25d15242c4938b72c391cb28a5
msgid "**分类：** 缺陷"
msgstr "**Category:** Defects"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:7
#: 7c2e21e8ba1e48b094a5a3cc84918956
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:9
#: e445e19cd81c4b52be4cbc7e5722e611
msgid ""
"按规则从指定元素的候选位点中均匀随机选择原子并删除。每条规则控制“删除哪种元"
"素、删除多少个、是否限制在已有 `group` 标签内”；没有被删除的原子坐标、晶胞和 "
"PBC 保持不变。"
msgstr "Uniformly sample and delete atoms from candidate sites of specified elements. Each rule controls which element to delete, how many atoms to delete, and whether to restrict sites to an existing `group`; coordinates, cell, and PBC of retained atoms remain unchanged."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:11
#: 3a12932990634361ae50dd83c2ba3c5b
msgid "**和 `Vacancy Defect Generation` 的区别：**"
msgstr "**How it differs from `Vacancy Defect Generation`:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:12
#: f27cb60b99f946159cf53f3c91a85acb
msgid ""
"`Random Vacancy`：规则驱动，按元素和已有 group 限定候选池，再随机选择具体位"
"点，适合定向研究某类空位缺陷"
msgstr "`Random Vacancy` is rule-driven: it restricts the candidate pool by element and existing groups, then samples specific sites. Use it to study a targeted vacancy-defect family."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:13
#: a8712fb2cfda4582a32354a4888394d1
msgid ""
"`Vacancy Defect Generation`：统计驱动，按整体浓度或数量随机删除，适合快速生成"
"低/中/高缺陷强度的分布样本"
msgstr ""
"`Vacancy Defect Generation` samples global counts or fractions for a broad "
"defect-density distribution."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:15
#: 34377a07c8c14088bd237ad98fea666a
msgid ""
"本卡不会识别表面、体相或化学子晶格。`group` 是输入结构中已经存在的 "
"`atoms.arrays[\"group\"]` 标签；如果规则填写了 group 而输入没有对应数组或标"
"签，卡片会明确报错，不会退化成全元素删位。"
msgstr "This card does not infer surfaces, bulk regions, or chemical sublattices. `group` refers to an existing `atoms.arrays[\"group\"]` label; if a rule specifies a group that is absent from the input, the card fails explicitly instead of falling back to deletion across all elements."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:17
#: 124628fe23d24ebbbdfcd25bcb197d8e
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principle and formulas"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:19
#: 1efc7af8d0974c34abe361de8f8206e4
msgid ""
"每条规则先用元素和可选 group 得到候选集合 $\\mathcal I_r$。`固定数量`从中无放"
"回抽取 指定的 $n_r$ 个位点；`随机数量`先在整数区间 $[n_{r,\\min},n_{r,\\max}]"
"$ 抽取 $n_r$，再抽位点。单条规则理论上有"
msgstr "Each rule first builds a candidate set $\\mathcal I_r$ from the element and optional group. `Fixed count` samples the specified $n_r$ sites without replacement; `Random count` first samples $n_r$ from the integer interval $[n_{r,\\min},n_{r,\\max}]$, then samples the sites. A single rule has, in principle,"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:23
#: 7fcf4b7ab70e43fd8c7f4e39c991b309
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\binom{|\\mathcal I_r|}{n_r}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:27
#: c1ea94aade434aa1b51442c23518d2d4
msgid ""
"种删除组合。多条规则依次应用并检查重复结果；若请求数量超过候选位点数会直接报"
"错，而不是 暗中降低空位数。固定种子会结合输入结构派生随机路径，使同一结构和参"
"数可复现。"
msgstr "deletion combinations. Multiple rules are applied in order and duplicate results are checked. If the request exceeds the available candidate sites, the card fails instead of silently reducing the vacancy count. A fixed seed is combined with the input structure to derive the random path, making identical structure-and-parameter runs reproducible."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:30
#: 0c519226d47c4eb4ba484386622bc9ba
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:32
#: 9afd5b505fb34e33a7bd130bbb15df51
msgid "场景：模型对表面氧空位预测完全错误"
msgstr "Scenario: The model fails on surface oxygen vacancies"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:34
#: 327bbacd034d4fcd92c8086bab1970d0
msgid ""
"你在 LiCoO2 上训练了一个 NEP 模型，体相性质预测很好，但一跑表面 slab 加氧空位"
"的构型，能量误差是体相的 3 倍。检查发现训练集里没有缺氧的结构，模型根本不知道"
"氧空位附近 Co 原子的局域环境长什么样。"
msgstr ""
"A LiCoO2 NEP predicts bulk properties well but triples its energy error for "
"an oxygen-deficient slab. The training set contains no oxygen vacancies and "
"therefore no undercoordinated Co environments adjacent to them."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:36
#: 0e6039d63095426eb514207449347b67
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** 氧空位周围，Co 原子从正常的 Co-O 八面体配位变成五配位甚至四配"
"位，键长、电荷分布都变了。训练集里只有完美晶体结构，模型完全靠外推处理这些配"
"位变化。需要往训练集中加入精确控制的氧空位构型，让模型见过\"氧被拿走\"之后的"
"配位环境。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** Removing O changes Co from octahedral toward five- or "
"fourfold coordination and modifies local bonds. Add controlled vacancy "
"structures, relax and label them, so these environments are in domain."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:38
#: e7df47c4ec4349bdbb936376d36a9463
msgid ""
"**输入：** 一个 LiCoO2 的 slab 结构，并且上游建模或导入流程已经写入 "
"`surface` / `bulk` group 标签"
msgstr "**Input:** a LiCoO2 slab whose upstream modeling or import workflow has written `surface` / `bulk` group labels"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:40
#: 7bfad14899f045f281d3e7b9cc3082bd
msgid ""
"**目标：** 只删表面层的氧原子，每次删 1~3 个，每帧生成 20 个不同落点的空位版"
"本"
msgstr ""
"**Objective:** Remove 1-3 O atoms only from the surface group and generate "
"20 site variants."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:42
#: fa6725798ca5406e9fc85f5c5eb4e472
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:43
#: 9a81c15844e64cc8b549de8cd55e1264
msgid ""
"`规则`（`rules`）：`[{\"element\":\"O\",\"count_mode\":\"random\",\"count\":"
"[1,3],\"group\":[\"surface\"]}]`"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:44
#: a3de091610184180ab263f59465fb87b
msgid "`Maximum Outputs per Input`：`20`"
msgstr "`Maximum Outputs per Input`: `20`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:45
#: f544235bc0624cabb8de5df7a7387a51
msgid "`Use Seed`：勾选，`随机种子`（`seed`）：`[42]`"
msgstr "Enable `Use Seed`; set `Random Seed` (`seed`) to `[42]`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:47
#: 23caf6053e374aaa938b4501d3598dc7
msgid ""
"**输出：** 最多 20 个不重复的空位结构，每个结构中 1~3 个表面氧被删除，带 "
"`Vac(n=...)` 标签。若可用位点组合不足，实际输出数会少于 20。"
msgstr "**Output:** up to 20 unique vacancy structures, each deleting 1–3 surface oxygen atoms and carrying a `Vac(n=...)` label. If too few site combinations are available, fewer than 20 outputs are produced."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:49
#: 3b262dbf0d05432bbe39fba3203ad543
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:50
#: f9c21eb5e54a49b5813160e3131e7873
msgid "重训后用同样含氧空位的表面结构推理，能量误差应显著下降"
msgstr ""
"After DFT labeling and retraining, energy error on held-out oxygen-vacancy "
"slabs should decrease."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:51
#: 0fe5fd1f22174edb8fa8c38835e1c4ee
msgid "抽查删除位置最近邻 Co 原子的键长分布是否在物理合理范围"
msgstr ""
"Inspect nearest-neighbor distances around the removed sites for physical "
"plausibility."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:52
#: 3f08038c29414f0fba99102b216cfcde
msgid ""
"如果只有表面需要空位，坚持用 group 约束；去掉 group 会生成体相空位，稀释训练"
"数据"
msgstr ""
"Keep the group restriction when only surface vacancies are relevant; "
"otherwise bulk vacancies dilute the target family."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:53
#: 95af4072357b4f399a941b1b49e703ad
msgid "如果需要同时覆盖体相和表面空位，加第二条规则不带 group"
msgstr ""
"To cover both bulk and surface vacancies, add a separate rule with the "
"intended region rather than mixing provenance."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:54
#: 346c422b066a4e62bb8c92429872615f
msgid ""
"删除操作不会自动弛豫空位近邻；进入训练集前应做几何检查，并按任务需要进行 DFT "
"弛豫或单点计算"
msgstr "Deletion does not automatically relax atoms neighboring a vacancy. Perform a geometry check before adding outputs to a training set and run DFT relaxation or single-point calculations as required."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:56
#: 42d0a59ae5054022b4d7c7ea9a307552
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:58
#: f1d48c7f33324db98316e0b02b7bdd76
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:59
#: 17d4e09cdae24103a9326839fc0fab18
msgid "需要按元素和 group 精确控制空位位置，而不是按整体浓度随机删"
msgstr "Vacancy sites must be controlled by element and group"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:60
#: e7f25690d8ea42e2b125563a9b4a8fec
msgid "研究特定元素的空位缺陷对模型预测的影响"
msgstr "A specific element-vacancy family is under study"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:61
#: 8e0f5ef18070413aa1f854cc0d4824b1
msgid "下游磁性卡需要特定子晶格有明确的 vacancy pattern"
msgstr ""
"A downstream magnetic workflow requires a defined vacancy pattern on one "
"sublattice"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:63
#: 19437eece37f48ceadc7c64679aaf294
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:64
#: 7635f6ab973046259e837672aafc8954
msgid "只需要整体浓度覆盖 → 用 `Vacancy Defect Generation`"
msgstr ""
"Only global concentration coverage is needed; use `Vacancy Defect Generation`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:65
#: 496099cf79dd420789d43c20a3e8fee1
msgid "体系本身原子数很少（<10），删任何一个都会剧烈改变化学计量比"
msgstr ""
"The structure has fewer than about 10 atoms and one removal would "
"drastically change stoichiometry"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:67
#: 2e3397a81ed040339ac7f638a9a11c7b
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:69
#: 11b8a51ec48f4b51b1c692bbd43e80ab
msgid "规则（rules）"
msgstr "rules"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:71
#: f6f9613fbe9b4543923b0060285074ee
msgid ""
"`list[dict[str, Any]]`，默认空列表。界面默认提供一条空规则；必须填写元素后才"
"能运行。"
msgstr "`list[dict[str, Any]]`, default empty. The interface provides one blank rule by default; an element must be entered before running."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:73
#: 2b883fd455b646829dcbba39cd70eb02
msgid "每条 rule 控制一次删除——删什么元素、删几个、在哪个 region 删："
msgstr "Each rule controls one removal operation: species, amount, and region."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:0
#: b87bf7ec3dcf475ea45eea6a629c9469
msgid "字段"
msgstr "Field"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:0
#: e6cb3c2c5d1e44d98154b2d607882cfb
msgid "类型"
msgstr "Type"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:0
#: 035412dba4be4c31a21c789812bf64bb
msgid "说明"
msgstr "Description"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:0
#: 2ac051c8b1834278b033bb7733966964
msgid "`element`"
msgstr "`element`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:0
#: 4f53c80fe60942d2ab19e9a7a8dffe5c 899c949787454f16ad29698d42c9a7fd
msgid "string"
msgstr "string"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:0
#: db9073144b7c4eadbb1e7aa395c7aeba
msgid "被删除的元素，如 `O`"
msgstr "Element to remove, such as `O`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:0
#: aa6e8493c7024776b84714dbb99f935c
msgid "`count_mode`"
msgstr "`count_mode`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:0
#: daf0c50024124987af90e21f7a53cba4
msgid ""
"`fixed` 精确删除 `count[0]` 个原子；`random` 在闭区间 `count[0]..count[1]` 中"
"随机"
msgstr "`fixed` deletes exactly `count[0]` atoms; `random` samples uniformly from the inclusive interval `count[0]..count[1]`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:0
#: 0ff2ff16997646399a03fdab575cabf5
msgid "`count`"
msgstr "`count`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:0
#: 76743fab3ce74f2dab6f19e569f360c8
msgid "[min, max]"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:0
#: 40c67803a80c425dbcf63af0c65890ce
msgid "固定数量写 `[n,n]`，随机范围写 `[min,max]`"
msgstr "Use `[n,n]` for a fixed count and `[min,max]` for a range"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:0
#: b1241d2e328549fb9c3ae6c2c10d97fd
msgid "`group`"
msgstr "`group`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:0
#: 5d8b0a1d056844c597725763b5a202d6
msgid "string / list（可选）"
msgstr "string / list (optional)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:0
#: 46d068b3f2944c51abfac2b406e6b18c
msgid ""
"限制只删除输入结构已有 group 标签内的原子。界面里可写 "
"`surface_top,surface_bottom`"
msgstr "Restrict deletion to atoms carrying existing group labels in the input. The interface accepts values such as `surface_top,surface_bottom`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:82
#: ef12e5c2052f44e9a20be03333701f62
msgid ""
"固定数量必须至少为 1；随机范围允许最小值为 0，以便把原始结构作为一个可能端"
"点，但最大值必须至少为 1。请求上限不能超过候选原子数，也不能把结构全部删空。"
msgstr "A fixed count must be at least 1. A random range may start at 0 so the original structure is one possible endpoint, but its maximum must be at least 1. The requested count cannot exceed the candidate atom count or delete every atom."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:84
#: 5d865a59fd3640899bd46e513370c878
msgid ""
"多条规则按顺序执行。如果两条规则的候选池重叠，第二条只会看到第一条删除后剩余"
"的原子。随机范围偶尔抽到不可行组合时，程序会丢弃这一次尝试并继续采样，不会因"
"为一个随机分支终止整张卡片；如果所有尝试都无法留下至少一个原子，才会明确报"
"错。"
msgstr "Rules run in order. If two candidate pools overlap, the second rule sees only atoms left after the first deletion. When a random range occasionally produces an infeasible combination, that attempt is discarded and sampling continues; the card fails only if every attempt would remove all atoms."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:86
#: 3d0f1f9408df47fb821c544dfe20ef06
msgid "最大结构数（max_structures）"
msgstr "max_structures"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:88
#: 8cacd468e11744bfa310862e569fadd5
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 1。每个输入帧最多保留多少个不同的空位版本。卡片按删除位点集合去"
"重，因此可用组合不足时输出会少于该值。"
msgstr "`int`, default 1. Maximum distinct vacancy variants retained per input frame. Outputs are deduplicated by deletion-site sets, so fewer are produced when too few combinations exist."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:90
#: 062f7142deac48a2a4edfd5cbe9b187d
msgid ""
"10~30 做定向验证，30~50 做常规覆盖，50~100 建议后接一张 `FPS Filter`，否则很"
"多空位落点在描述符空间里高度重复。"
msgstr ""
"Use roughly 10-30 variants for targeted validation and 30-50 for routine "
"coverage. At 50-100, consider FPS because many site choices can be "
"descriptor-near-duplicates."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:92
#: 05a811209984497495dfe6d24b94f255
msgid "使用随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr "use_seed"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:94
#: 8e0b6dfe58ec4d0783bc2a381e379653
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 false。打开后同一结构内容 + 同一参数 + 同一 seed 会得到完全相同"
"的删除结果。不同输入结构会派生不同随机序列，改变数据集顺序不会改变单帧结果。"
msgstr "`bool`, default false. When enabled, identical structure content, parameters, and seed produce exactly the same deletions. Different input structures derive different random sequences, so reordering the dataset does not change a frame's result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:96
#: e55da6517dd448ca863ed92167fc32fe
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr "seed"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:98
#: 1c6c1aa33afc4ac59d32eecb44366f36
msgid "`int`，默认 0。随机种子值。"
msgstr "`int`, default `0`. Random seed value."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:100
#: 37d2a5e9f13b44379c0c91a683408449
msgid "生效条件：`use_seed=True`。"
msgstr "Active only when `use_seed=True`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:102
#: cb9f0cdf8c6b43b2865769a127070c20
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:104
#: af8c9d74a0894c84aa0cdf0da9a756d0
