#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:153
#: 8ee075dc51034b5db50e1a932d23050b
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:155
#: f7ea000ea1464bf28e106ae5adcc59e6
msgid ""
"`Group Label` → `Random Vacancy`：可按坐标规则生成 A/B 两组后定向删位；"
"`Group Label` 不会自动识别 surface/bulk 或化学子晶格"
msgstr "`Group Label` → `Random Vacancy`: create A/B groups by coordinate rules and delete sites selectively; `Group Label` does not infer surface/bulk regions or chemical sublattices."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:156
#: f213c41c73dc4a09984092b0daf48f4c
msgid ""
"已有 `surface` / `bulk` / `sublattice` 标签 → `Random Vacancy`：直接填写已有"
"标签定向删位"
msgstr "Existing `surface` / `bulk` / `sublattice` labels → `Random Vacancy`: enter the existing labels to target deletion directly."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:157
#: ee3502527fea4afe9a5d0dc50cb455f3
msgid ""
"`Super Cell` → `Random Vacancy`：先扩胞到足够大，避免小胞里缺陷相互作用过强"
msgstr ""
"`Super Cell` -> `Random Vacancy`: enlarge first to reduce periodic vacancy "
"interactions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:158
#: 0c247615609c4c3e9a9d5d9f34fad286
msgid "`Random Vacancy` → `FPS Filter`：大批量生成后做代表性筛选"
msgstr ""
"`Random Vacancy` -> `FPS Filter`: select representatives from a large site "
"sample"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:160
#: a9cc9f354497466c9703cb20c52d9128
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:162
#: 68e3d7cceabd4491aee27b4316de0f7b
msgid ""
"**提示“需要填写元素”。** 默认规则仍为空；填写要删除的元素符号，例如 `O`。"
msgstr "**The card says an element is required.** The default rule is still empty; enter the symbol of the element to delete, such as `O`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:164
#: b34b7f438f0645c486710a5826c1e051
msgid ""
"**提示输入没有 group 或没有匹配原子。** 本卡不会猜测或忽略 group。先确认输入"
"结构确实带有对应 `atoms.arrays[\"group\"]` 标签，或清空规则中的 group 限制。"
msgstr "**The input has no group or no matching atoms.** This card does not guess or ignore groups. Confirm that the input contains the corresponding `atoms.arrays[\"group\"]` labels, or clear the group restriction in the rule."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:166
#: 8721fe1b493846a1ac39756873966645
msgid ""
"**生成数少于设置值。** 输出会按删除位点集合去重。例如只有一个 O 位点且固定删"
"除 1 个时，不论上限设置多大都只有一种结构。"
msgstr "**Fewer structures were generated than requested.** Outputs are deduplicated by deletion-site sets. For example, one O site with a fixed deletion count of 1 produces only one structure regardless of the configured limit."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:168
#: f4a0450f6d9b48ec9b32b8b70a422828
msgid ""
"**删位后局部结构不合理。** 本卡只删除原子，不移动剩余原子。在小胞中删除过多原"
"子会产生不合理化学计量和强缺陷相互作用；应先扩胞，并在下游进行几何检查或弛"
"豫。"
msgstr "**The local structure is unreasonable after deletion.** This card only deletes atoms and does not move the remainder. Deleting too many atoms in a small cell can create unreasonable stoichiometry and strong defect interactions; expand the cell first, then perform downstream geometry checks or relaxation."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:170
#: 1d7e485594554520abf9107f0e3641fe
msgid ""
"**多条规则交互异常。** 规则顺序执行。如果一条规则删了大量原子，下一条规则的候"
"选池会变小。随机模式会跳过偶发的不可行组合；如果持续提示无法生成非空结构，说"
"明规则的固定数量或最小删除数已经互相冲突，应减少删除数、拆开 group，或先扩"
"胞。"
msgstr "**Multiple rules interact unexpectedly.** Rules run in order, so deleting many atoms with one rule shrinks the next rule's candidate pool. Random mode skips occasional infeasible combinations; if no non-empty structure can be generated repeatedly, the fixed counts or minimum deletions conflict. Reduce the deletion counts, split groups, or expand the cell first."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:172
#: 42540a8be9404326a7143aad5db14cf9
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:174
#: 8f278f93e2e04dd090c4a1aa7bc051ee
msgid "`Vac(n={删除原子数})`"
msgstr "`Vac(n={number of removed atoms})`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:176
#: b46bdc51060342ff9807d087d350f38e
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:178
#: 2fdd8427e3f3421e9586e5f2d621af56
msgid ""
"勾选 `使用随机种子`（`use_seed`）并固定 `随机种子`（`seed`）后，随机序列由 "
"seed 与单帧结构内容共同决定：同一结构可复现，不同结构不会机械复用同一组原子编"
"号，数据集重新排序也不改变单帧结果。"
msgstr "When `Use Seed` (`use_seed`) is enabled with a fixed `Seed` (`seed`), the random sequence is determined by the seed and each frame's structure content: the same structure is reproducible, different structures do not mechanically reuse the same atom indices, and reordering the dataset does not change a frame's result."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "按规则表对指定元素原子做删除操作，生成可控的空位缺陷结构。每条规则精确控制"
#~ "\"删除什么元素、删多少个、在哪个 region 删\"，支持元素过滤和 group 区域约"
#~ "束。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Generate controlled vacancies by removing atoms according to explicit "
#~ "rules. Each rule specifies the element, count, and optional group region."

#~ msgid ""
