#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Input:** A LiCoO2 slab whose surface and bulk regions were marked with "
#~ "`Group Label`."

#~ msgid "`Use Seed`：勾选，`Seed`：`[42]`"
#~ msgstr "Enable `Use Seed` and set `Seed` to `[42]`."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输出：** 20 个空位结构，每帧中 1~3 个表面氧被删除，带 `Vac(n=...)` 标签"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Output:** Twenty structures with 1-3 surface O atoms removed, labeled "
#~ "`Vac(n=...)`."

