#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Output is unchanged.** Check for nonempty rules, an element present in "
#~ "the input, and group filters that leave eligible sites."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**删完骨架塌缩。** 检查 count 上限是否太长。在 20 原子小胞里删 10 个必然"
#~ "崩。先扩胞再删。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**The framework collapses after removal.** The count is too large for the "
#~ "cell. Expand first or reduce the vacancy amount."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**多条规则交互异常。** 规则顺序执行。如果一条规则删了大量原子，下一条规则"
#~ "的候选池可能已经变了。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Rules interact unexpectedly.** They execute sequentially, so early "
#~ "removals change the candidate pool seen by later rules."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "勾选 `use_seed` + 固定 `seed` → 相同输入可复现。输入结构顺序变化也会影响结"
